{
  "$comment": "Manifest for the versioned fleet contract bundle (ARC-ADR-034). The single source of truth for what spokes pin + codegen from. `node tools/contracts-package.mjs` gathers each artifact FROM ITS PRODUCER repo (hub or a sibling spoke), packages them as ONE OCI artifact, and pushes it to GHCR (cosign-signed) via ORAS. This bundle REPLACES the hand-copied vendoring (e.g. backend-core.openapi.json copied into frontend-core, agui-stream duplicated, fleet-interface/ vendored 3×) — consumers pull one pinned version instead. Mirrors the 'shipped' rows of docs/contracts.md; add a row as each backlog contract ships. siblingRoot: where the spoke checkouts live relative to the hub (default = the hub's parent dir; CI checks the spokes out there or uses the ARC-ADR-034 read token).",
